          "text": "31",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spake unto Moses, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "See, I have called by name Bezaleel the son of Uri, the son of Hur, of the tribe of Judah:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I have filled him with the spirit of God, in wisdom, and in understanding, and in knowledge, and in all manner of workmanship,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To devise cunning works, to work in gold, and in silver, and in brass,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And in cutting of stones, to set",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and in carving of timber, to work in all manner of workmanship.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I, behold, I have given with him Aholiab, the son of Ahisamach, of the tribe of Dan: and in the hearts of all that are wise hearted I have put wisdom, that they may make all that I have commanded thee;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The tabernacle of the congregation, and the ark of the testimony, and the mercy seat that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thereupon, and all the furniture of the tabernacle,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the table and his furniture, and the pure candlestick with all his furniture, and the altar of incense,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the altar of burnt offering with all his furniture, and the laver and his foot,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the cloths of service, and the holy garments for Aaron the priest, and the garments of his sons, to minister in the priest's office,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the anointing oil, and sweet incense for the holy",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "place:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "according to all that I have commanded thee shall they do.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spake unto Moses, saying,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Speak thou also unto the children of Israel, saying, Verily my sabbaths ye shall keep: for it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a sign between me and you throughout your generations; that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "ye",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "may know that I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that doth sanctify you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye shall keep the sabbath therefore; for it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "holy unto you: every one that defileth it shall surely be put to death: for whosoever doeth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "work therein, that soul shall be cut off from among his people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Six days may work be done; but in the seventh",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the sabbath of rest, holy to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ": whosoever doeth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "work in the sabbath day, he shall surely be put to death.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore the children of Israel shall keep the sabbath, to observe the sabbath throughout their generations,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a perpetual covenant.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a sign between me and the children of Israel for ever: for",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "in",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "six days the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.31.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.31.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "made heaven and earth, and on the seventh day he rested, and was refreshed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And he gave unto Moses, when he had made an end of communing with him upon mount Sinai, two tables of testimony, tables of stone, written with the finger of God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
